dr14tmeter (2.2.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * New release 2.2.0.
  * Add the interactive terminal browser (TUI) for database queries and
    ANSI colour support.
  * Add the album, artist, genre and collection info queries
    (-q artist, -q album, -q genres, -q info).
  * Update the database schema to version 2.
  * Add the dr14_tmeter man page.
  * Update the project URLs.

 -- Simone Riva <simone.rva@gmail.com>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:36:49 +0100

