dr14tmeter (2.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Build with dh-python and pybuild for Python 3, replacing cdbs and
    python-support.
  * Use debhelper compat level 13 and the 3.0 (native) source format.
  * Drop the Python 2, libav-tools, flac and faad dependencies, and depend
    on vorbis-tools for oggdec.

 -- Simone Riva <simone.rva@gmail.com>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:41:42 +0200

